# Only docs and the build contract go to GitHub. The masters live in Drive.
# Rule-owner: RENDER-TARGETS.md in the toolkit. GitHub has a 25 MB soft limit
# and a 4K master is 40-200 MB, so the videos are never committed.

*.mp4
*.mov
*.wav
*.aiff
